abstract: >-
  A bounded synthetic research prototype with a preserved historical archive,
  deterministic archive checks, and an offline measurement-interface repair.
  It does not represent a new live-model study or a release of the historical
  v1 software.
keywords:
  - agent evaluation
  - configuration shifts
  - constraint safety
  - synthetic environments
